Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix 3 bugs: counter-referral scope, AI step validation,
 profile refresh

- CounterReferralView v3: load both incoming + outgoing referrals with
direction badges and filter controls
- ReferralForm: fix canNext() to validate destinationStationName instead
of destinationStationId, auto-generate ID on submit if empty
- useAuth: add refreshUser() that fetches fresh /api/v1/users/me and
updates context + localStorage
- CollectorProfile: call refreshUser() after successful save so edits
reflect everywhere in the system
